WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:04,020
Hahaha

2
00:00:05,510 --> 00:00:06,710
I'm not coming

3
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:17,110
Our fighter planes are pretty good today

4
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:19,110
A total of twenty-three doors were opened.

5
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:20,510
I got ten packs of canned noodles.

6
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:21,910
Three large barrels of mineral water

7
00:00:21,910 --> 00:00:23,110
two sliders

8
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:24,310
Fourteen packs of instant noodles

9
00:00:24,510 --> 00:00:26,310
These are all ours

10
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:28,110
These supplies

11
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:30,110
Most of them are found in homes where there are no living people.

12
00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:32,710
Thank you for their disregard and they disappeared on the first day.

13
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:34,110
No materials wasted

14
00:00:34,110 --> 00:00:35,510
Just today’s harvest

15
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:37,910
It's enough to keep us fed for two days.

16
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:39,740
In addition to supplies

17
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:41,340
There are people waiting for us

18
00:00:41,540 --> 00:00:42,540
Boss Niu

19
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:43,740
How is this indifference?

20
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:45,940
This is simply heaven, boss

21
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:50,650
When are we going to attack Wang Sheng’s wife? Yes, boss.

22
00:00:50,650 --> 00:00:52,050
Yes, yes, it should have been done long ago

23
00:00:52,050 --> 00:00:53,850
I met Wang Sheng when he got married last month.

24
00:00:53,850 --> 00:00:55,250
I also took several photos

25
00:00:55,250 --> 00:00:56,450
So beautiful

26
00:00:56,450 --> 00:00:57,450
Gems listen to you

27
00:00:57,450 --> 00:00:58,450
I haven't seen it

28
00:00:58,450 --> 00:00:59,450
Is it really that beautiful?

29
00:00:59,450 --> 00:01:00,450
Why are you lying to me?

30
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:04,730
A line that is even better than the female stars on TV

31
00:01:05,330 --> 00:01:06,530
Leave a few brothers to watch here

32
00:01:07,160 --> 00:01:08,560
The others follow me downstairs
